cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills in your work, please cite them as below."
title: "Lizo's Skills Marketplace"
abstract: >-
  A curated set of Agent Skills authored by Liz Osborn, following the open
  agentskills.io standard. Includes onboarding-psychologist (a behavioral-
  research framework for first-time-user flows) and ai-agents-architect
  (a decision framework for autonomous-agent architecture). Compatible with
  Claude Code, Cursor, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, Junie, Goose, Amp, and other
  Agent-Skills-compliant clients.
type: software
